  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/03/IMG_20210310_201414.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(15 fotos) El pleno ordinario trimestral de la Mancomunidad Espad&aacute;n Mijares ha conocido la liquidaci&oacute;n del presupuesto de 2020, que arroja un remanente de tesorer&iacute;a para gastos generales de 230.507,29 euros.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/03/IMG_20210310_204705.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>La resoluci&oacute;n del presidente, Vicente Juan Prades Ramos, presentada en la sesi&oacute;n arroja un resultado presupuestario ajustado de 10.434,69 euros.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plemancoprimertrimestre/IMG_20210310_201414.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210310_201414\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plemancoprimertrimestre/IMG_20210310_201441.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210310_201441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plemancoprimertrimestre/IMG_20210310_201456.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210310_201456\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plemancoprimertrimestre/IMG_20210310_201509.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210310_201509\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plemancoprimertrimestre/IMG_20210310_201550.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210310_201550\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plemancoprimertrimestre/IMG_20210310_202657.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20210310_202657\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plemancoprimertrimestre/IMG_20210